posts.text:
This one really took a lot out of me. 😭🔥

Sleepless nights, countless hours of drawing, animating, editing, syncing voiceovers, adding sound effects, and putting every little detail together.

From the first frame to the final sound, I did everything myself. No AI generated animation, no shortcuts. Just me, my ideas, and a whole lot of patience.

There were moments I got frustrated, moments I wanted to give up, but I kept pushing until I finally got it done.

I wanted to create something that actually feels like effort went into it, not just another promo video.

Here's my entry for #Gamdom100kRound2.

Must fight back when kicked down. 👊🏿

Hope you enjoy watching it as much as I enjoyed bringing it to life.

